# Router runtime state — ephemeral per-message files. These must NEVER be
# version-controlled (ROUTER_V2_DURABLE_DISPATCH /goal #2: "zero router runtime
# files tracked in git; git status after 100 sends/closes shows a clean tree").
# The file-based router writes these live on every send/close/heartbeat; git
# tracks only durable config (agents.json), scripts (*.sh), and docs (*.md).
items/
reviews/
proposals/
decisions/
police/
logs/
state.json
threads.json
processes.json
dispatch-ledger.json
*.ledger
.processes.json
.threads.json
.agents.json-*
